    "notes": "内部只选常量的 EXISTS：删空 orders 会清空结果，orders 行集标记属于 existence（行集为空原因）；内层匹配列属于 control；两张表的任何列都不得出现在 value"
  },
  "15_exists_projection_placeholder.sql": {
    "expected_status": "ok",
    "fields": {
      "customer_name": {
        "value": [
          "shop.main.customers.name"
        ],
        "control_contains": [
          "shop.main.orders.customer_id",
          "shop.main.customers.customer_id"
        ],
